OL,3,AData centres and pipelines up for grabs
OL,4,Aas Carney pitches Canada to investment
OL,5,Agiants
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Mark Carney is pitching
OL,8,FCanada as a "safe harbour" for some of
OL,9,Fthe world's largest investors in an era
OL,10,Fof geopolitical and economic
OL,11,Funcertainty.
OL,13,FCanada is "perfectly situated to build
OL,14,Fin the new global economic order", he
OL,15,Ftold more than 100 major investors in
OL,16,FToronto.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
