OL,3,AData centres and pipelines up for grabs
OL,4,Aas Carney pitches Canada to investment
OL,5,Agiants
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister has pledged to bring
OL,8,Fin C$1tn ($720bn; #530bn) in
OL,9,Finvestments in the b@Lnext bA five
OL,10,Fyears as he seeks to reduce Canada's
OL,11,Freliance on the US, and the summit he
OL,12,Fconvened this week is a test of whether
OL,13,Fhe can deliver on promises to
OL,14,Fstrengthen economic resilience.
OL,16,FThe stakes are high as the trade
OL,17,Fdispute with the US has pushed Canada
OL,18,Fto seek deeper economic partnerships
OL,19,Fwith Europe, Asia and the Middle East.
